WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.211 --> 00:00:03.484
- He was a popular American author.

00:00:03.484 --> 00:00:05.805
- He wrote the book Think and Grow Rich.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:09.169
- He's Napoleon Hill and here
are his top ten rules for

00:00:09.169 --> 00:00:10.783
success.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:13.582
(wooshing noise)

00:00:13.582 --> 00:00:15.276
- A definite purpose must
be accompanied by a definite

00:00:15.276 --> 00:00:16.852
plan for detainment, followed
by appropriate action,

00:00:16.852 --> 00:00:19.613
now you have to have a
purpose, you have to have a

00:00:19.613 --> 00:00:22.941
plan, and you have to start
putting that plan into action.

00:00:22.941 --> 00:00:25.062
And ladies and gentlemen,
it's not too important that

00:00:25.062 --> 00:00:26.645
your plan be sound.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.542
It is in fact, it's not too
important because if you find

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:34.460
that you've adopted a plan
that is not sound, it's

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:35.922
not working you can always change.

00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:39.321
You can modify your plan,
but it is very important that

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:41.870
you be definite about what
it is you're going after,

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:45.203
what your purpose is, that
must be very definite.

00:00:45.203 --> 00:00:47.709
Learn to adjust yourself
to other people's state of

00:00:47.709 --> 00:00:50.663
mind and difficulties so
as to get along peacefully

00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:54.019
with them and to refrain
from taking notice of trivial

00:00:54.019 --> 00:00:56.555
circumstances in your
relations with other people by

00:00:56.555 --> 00:01:00.229
refusing to allow them
to become controversial

00:01:00.229 --> 00:01:01.754
incidents.

00:01:01.754 --> 00:01:05.577
Great people always avoid
small incidents of controversy

00:01:05.577 --> 00:01:06.744
when possible.

00:01:07.641 --> 00:01:12.173
If you want the mind to
pick up an idea, and to form

00:01:12.173 --> 00:01:16.799
a habit so that the mind
will automatically act upon

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:19.836
that idea you've got to
tell the mind what you want

00:01:19.836 --> 00:01:22.968
over and over and over again.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:24.051
No end to it.

00:01:25.506 --> 00:01:28.486
When Mr. Coue came over
here some years ago with his

00:01:28.486 --> 00:01:32.564
famous formula, day by day
in every way I'm getting

00:01:32.564 --> 00:01:37.307
better and better, he
cured thousands of people

00:01:37.307 --> 00:01:40.483
but a very great number
than that he didn't cure.

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:42.414
And I wonder if you would know why?

00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:45.921
(audience murmuring)

00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:49.294
There was no desire, there
was no feeling put into that

00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:51.447
statement, you might as
well just blow into the wind

00:01:51.447 --> 00:01:53.601
as to make a statement to
let you put some feeling

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:56.434
back of it, unless you believe it.

00:01:57.874 --> 00:02:02.328
Well you need a pocket sized
notebook, all something

00:02:02.328 --> 00:02:05.443
on the order of this one
here, looseleaf at that.

00:02:05.443 --> 00:02:09.461
And on the page one write
down a clear description of

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.544
your major desire in life.

00:02:11.544 --> 00:02:14.735
The one circumstance or
position or thing which you

00:02:14.735 --> 00:02:18.042
will be willing to accept
as your idea of success.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:21.610
And remember before you
begin writing that your only

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:24.477
limitations are those that
you set up in your own

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.999
mind or permit others to set up for you.

00:02:27.999 --> 00:02:32.275
And two, on page two of
your notebook, write down a

00:02:32.275 --> 00:02:35.514
clear statement of precisely
what you intend to give

00:02:35.514 --> 00:02:39.448
in return for that which you
desire from life and then

00:02:39.448 --> 00:02:44.071
start in right where you
stand now to begin giving and

00:02:44.071 --> 00:02:48.238
three, memorize both of your
statements, what you desire

00:02:50.513 --> 00:02:53.433
and what you intend to
give in return for it.

00:02:53.433 --> 00:02:56.855
And repeat them at least a
dozen times daily and always

00:02:56.855 --> 00:03:00.341
end your statements with
this expression of gratitude

00:03:00.341 --> 00:03:04.471
for the blessings with which
you were gifted at birth.

00:03:04.471 --> 00:03:06.795
Any dominating desire,
plan, or purpose which is

00:03:06.795 --> 00:03:08.957
backed by that state of mind
known as faith, is taken

00:03:08.957 --> 00:03:11.304
over by the subconscious
section of the mind and acted

00:03:11.304 --> 00:03:12.721
upon immediately.

00:03:14.205 --> 00:03:16.852
I don't know for sure ladies
and gentlemen, but I suspect

00:03:16.852 --> 00:03:18.580
that there's a relatively
small number of people

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.456
in the world at any one
time who understand the

00:03:20.456 --> 00:03:22.605
principle of faith, who
really understand it and know

00:03:22.605 --> 00:03:23.938
how to apply it.

00:03:25.767 --> 00:03:28.288
And even if you do understand
it, if you don't back

00:03:28.288 --> 00:03:32.026
it up with action and make
it a part of your habit life

00:03:32.026 --> 00:03:35.643
you might just as well
not understand it because

00:03:35.643 --> 00:03:37.976
faith without deeds is dead.

00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:43.486
Faith without action is
dead, faith without absolute

00:03:43.486 --> 00:03:45.486
positive belief is dead.

00:03:48.774 --> 00:03:50.638
I don't know how you're
going to get any results

00:03:50.638 --> 00:03:52.881
through believing unless
you put some action back of

00:03:52.881 --> 00:03:53.881
that belief.

00:03:55.175 --> 00:03:57.251
And incidentally, if you tell
your mind often enough that

00:03:57.251 --> 00:04:00.093
you have faith in anything,
the time will come when your

00:04:00.093 --> 00:04:03.147
subconscious mind will
accept that, even if you tell

00:04:03.147 --> 00:04:08.138
your mind often enough that
you have faith in yourself.

00:04:08.138 --> 00:04:11.970
Have you ever thought about
nice thing would be if

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.680
you had such complete faith
in yourself that you wouldn't

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.187
hesitate to undertake anything
you wanted to do in life?

00:04:16.187 --> 00:04:17.890
Had you ever thought about that?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.655
What a benefit that would be to you?

00:04:19.655 --> 00:04:22.209
Your personality determines
whether people are attracted

00:04:22.209 --> 00:04:25.283
to you or shy away from
you, it is the show in which

00:04:25.283 --> 00:04:29.071
you display your character
to the world and it is

00:04:29.071 --> 00:04:31.663
the one thing which
distinguishes you from all other

00:04:31.663 --> 00:04:33.551
human beings.

00:04:33.551 --> 00:04:36.885
It is your trademark by which
people recognize you and

00:04:36.885 --> 00:04:39.664
it is the thing which determines
your success or failure

00:04:39.664 --> 00:04:42.000
in selling yourself through life.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.837
Therefore, you should see your
personality just as others

00:04:44.837 --> 00:04:46.686
see it, so you may improve it
where it needs improvement.

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:50.853
If you would sit down and put
an hour by hour of account

00:04:53.649 --> 00:04:56.217
of the actual work that
you put in each day for one

00:04:56.217 --> 00:04:59.376
week and then an hour by
hour account of the time

00:04:59.376 --> 00:05:01.114
that you waste that you
could devote to anything you

00:05:01.114 --> 00:05:02.960
want to do badly enough.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.851
You're going to get one of
the shocks of your life.

00:05:04.851 --> 00:05:08.359
We're not efficient, you know
we have about eight hours

00:05:08.359 --> 00:05:09.735
to sleep, about eight
hours to earn a living, and

00:05:09.735 --> 00:05:12.838
have eight hours of free
time that you can do anything

00:05:12.838 --> 00:05:15.986
that you want to with here in
this country where we live.

00:05:15.986 --> 00:05:18.900
And then definiteness as a
purpose makes one more alert

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.519
in recognizing opportunities
related to the object of

00:05:21.519 --> 00:05:25.623
one's major purpose and it
inspires the courage to embrace

00:05:25.623 --> 00:05:28.494
and act upon those opportunities.

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:32.806
Now, we all see opportunities
almost everyday of our lives

00:05:32.806 --> 00:05:36.164
which if we embrace them and
acted upon them could benefit

00:05:36.164 --> 00:05:39.629
us, but there's something in us that we

00:05:39.629 --> 00:05:42.806
call procrastination, we
just don't have the will,

00:05:42.806 --> 00:05:46.396
the alertness, the determination
to embrace opportunities

00:05:46.396 --> 00:05:47.685
when they come along.

00:05:47.685 --> 00:05:50.362
But if you condition your mind
with this philosophy, you'll

00:05:50.362 --> 00:05:52.325
not only embrace opportunities,
but you'll do something

00:05:52.325 --> 00:05:54.413
better, what could you
do better than embrace

00:05:54.413 --> 00:05:55.769
an opportunity?

00:05:55.769 --> 00:05:56.937
(audience speaking)

00:05:56.937 --> 00:06:00.104
Make the opportunity, that's the idea.

00:06:01.018 --> 00:06:03.862
Success is something which
has to be planned and

00:06:03.862 --> 00:06:06.793
success is something which
has to be earned in advance.

00:06:06.793 --> 00:06:10.498
True, there is such a thing
as luck, but just remember

00:06:10.498 --> 00:06:13.399
luck is something that you
can create for yourself

00:06:13.399 --> 00:06:16.124
if you know the rules and
follow them just as I give

00:06:16.124 --> 00:06:17.482
them to you.

00:06:17.482 --> 00:06:19.974
Remember too that success
in the higher brackets of

00:06:19.974 --> 00:06:22.024
achievement is something
that can be had only by

00:06:22.024 --> 00:06:26.328
taking others along with you
and the best definition of

00:06:26.328 --> 00:06:29.660
success which I know is this,
success is the knowledge

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:33.630
with which to get whatever
you want from life without

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.722
violating the rights of
others and by helping others

00:06:36.722 --> 00:06:37.889
to acquire it.

00:06:38.739 --> 00:06:42.134
The very minute that you
decide upon something, you

00:06:42.134 --> 00:06:44.408
know that's what you want,
you know you're going to do

00:06:44.408 --> 00:06:46.706
it, all of these negative
that have been bothering

00:06:46.706 --> 00:06:49.424
you, they pick up their
baggage and get out.

00:06:49.424 --> 00:06:51.439
They just move out, they
can't live in a positive

00:06:51.439 --> 00:06:54.259
mind, can you imagine a
negative frame of mind and a

00:06:54.259 --> 00:06:56.233
positive frame of mind
occupying the same space at

00:06:56.233 --> 00:06:57.521
the same time?

00:06:57.521 --> 00:06:58.444
Could you imagine that?

00:06:58.444 --> 00:07:01.147
No, you can't cuz it can't
be done and did you know that

00:07:01.147 --> 00:07:05.082
the slightest bit of a
negative and mental attitude is

00:07:05.082 --> 00:07:08.073
sufficient to destroy the power of prayer?

00:07:08.073 --> 00:07:10.857
Did you know that the slightest
bit of a negative mental

00:07:10.857 --> 00:07:13.108
attitude is sufficient to
destroy your plan, whatever

00:07:13.108 --> 00:07:14.420
it is you're doing?

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:17.674
Carrying out your definiteness of purpose?

00:07:17.674 --> 00:07:20.876
You have to move with
courage, with faith, with

00:07:20.876 --> 00:07:23.931
determination in connection
with carrying out your

00:07:23.931 --> 00:07:26.521
definiteness of purpose.

00:07:26.521 --> 00:07:29.785
Whatever the mind can
conceive and believe, the

00:07:29.785 --> 00:07:31.202
mind can achieve.

00:07:32.892 --> 00:07:36.082
Isn't that a profound statement?

00:07:36.082 --> 00:07:38.608
You will notice that it
says nothing about the need

00:07:38.608 --> 00:07:41.064
for education, but simply
that whatever your mind can

00:07:41.064 --> 00:07:45.417
conceive and believe
your mind can achieve.

00:07:45.417 --> 00:07:48.757
Now if you want evidence
that the mind can achieve

00:07:48.757 --> 00:07:51.389
whatever the mind can
conceive without the benefit

00:07:51.389 --> 00:07:55.127
of formal education, you'll
have to remember that

00:07:55.127 --> 00:07:58.575
Thomas A. Edison conceived
the idea of becoming an

00:07:58.575 --> 00:08:02.163
inventor and lived to
become the world's greatest

00:08:02.163 --> 00:08:06.481
scientist in the field
of invention, with only

00:08:06.481 --> 00:08:10.006
three months of common school education.

00:08:10.006 --> 00:08:12.190
- Thank you so much for
watching, I made this video

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:15.094
because Business asked
me to, so if there's a

00:08:15.094 --> 00:08:17.394
famous entrepreneur that
you want me to profile next,

00:08:17.394 --> 00:08:19.232
leave it in the comments below and I'll

00:08:19.232 --> 00:08:20.548
see what I can do.

00:08:20.548 --> 00:08:22.847
I'd also love to know which
of Napoleon Hill's top

00:08:22.847 --> 00:08:26.126
ten rules you loved the most,
leave it in the comments.

00:08:26.126 --> 00:08:28.739
We're going to join in the
discussion, thank you so much

00:08:28.739 --> 00:08:31.698
for watching, continue to
believe and I'll see you soon.

00:08:31.698 --> 00:08:34.272
(whooshing noise)

